ground_truth:
{
    "summary": "Mastodon had a significantly higher total post volume than Reddit in 2024, and while their overall trends varied in the first half of the year, both platforms followed a similar pattern of reaching their annual low in September followed by a sharp recovery in October.",
    "key_points": [
      "Mastodon recorded a total of 18,000,000+ posts in 2024, which is over ten times the posts volume recorded for Reddit in the same period.",
      "Both platforms experienced their lowest activity of the year in September.",
      "Both platforms saw a significant increase in activity in October, with Mastodon reaching its yearly peak. ",
      "Reddit's highest activity occurred at the start of the year in January, followed by a general decline through June.",
      "Mastodon's volume was more volatile throughout the first half of the year, with notable peaks in February and May."
    ]
  }

